          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><em><span color="rgba(0, 112, 192, 1)" fontSize="18" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">科研</span></em></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="391.11850393700786" height="101.53196850393701" topLeftX="518.0339370078739" topLeftY="244.55385826771652" presetHandlers="0" type="round-rect" id="bHa">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><em><span color="rgba(0, 112, 192, 1)" fontSize="18" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">面向麻醉科医生与围术期团队：术前评估输入患者病历与监护波形，输出风险分级与麻醉关注点报告；</span></em></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.8" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><em><span color="rgba(0, 112, 192, 1)" fontSize="18" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">基层医院可借此补齐评估规范性，缓解麻醉医生短缺下的评估质量压力。</span></em></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="400" height="160" topLeftX="47" topLeftY="230" type="text" id="bHU">
        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" marginRight="0"><span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="14" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">术前风险评估是麻醉科真实刚需：医生手工翻病历、逐项核对 ASA 等评分并对照指南，一次约 20—40 分钟且易漏项，基层医院更缺人。</span></p>
          <p textAlign="left" marginRight="0"><span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="14" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">PeriRisk Agent 基于大模型 Function Calling 自主调度：输入病历与监护波形，Agent 主动查病历、读波形算心率、按规则判定 ASA 分级，集齐后一键生成【风险评估】【麻醉关注点】【建议】三段式报告。</span></p>
        </content>
