          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><em><span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">进展：Demo 已跑通，命令行 + Streamlit，GitHub 可复现；5 例批量测试：ASA 分级一致率 </span></em><strong><em><span color="rgba(192, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" strikethrough="false" underline="false">100%</span></em></strong><em><span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">、工具调用顺序正确率 </span></em><strong><em><span color="rgba(192, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" strikethrough="false" underline="false">100%</span></em></strong><em><span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">，心率算法误差 </span></em><strong><em><span color="rgba(192, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" strikethrough="false" underline="false">5.7 次/分</span></em></strong><em><span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">（88.0 vs 监护仪 82.3）；</span></em></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><em><span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">依赖：DeepSeek API、Python(scipy)、VitalDB；后续接入 openJiuwen / JiuwenSwarm；</span></em></p>
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><em><span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">Demo：3 分钟视频，展示多轮思考与工具调用，输出三段式报告。</span></em></p>
        </content>
